@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Silver ground-truth triples for example729
# Source: 2WikiMultihopQA dev split, evidences field
# Predicates use this project's ontology (see ontology.ttl)

